{"suttaId":"an10.16","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"A-x","vriCode":"s0404m3.mul","paras":[100,100],"vripara":"16"},"segments":{"an10.16:0.3":"Āhuneyyasuttaṃ","an10.16:1.1":"“Dasayime, bhikkhave, puggalā āhuneyyā pāhuneyyā dakkhiṇeyyā añjalikaraṇīyā anuttaraṃ puññakkhettaṃ lokassa.","an10.16:1.2":"Katame dasa?","an10.16:1.3":"Tathāgato arahaṃ sammāsambuddho, paccekabuddho, ubhatobhāgavimutto, paññāvimutto, kāyasakkhī, diṭṭhippatto, saddhāvimutto, saddhānusārī, dhammānusārī, gotrabhū – ime kho, bhikkhave, dasa puggalā āhuneyyā … pe … anuttaraṃ puññakkhettaṃ lokassā”ti.","an10.16:1.5":"Chaṭṭhaṃ."},"attha":{"book":"Mp-x","bookName":"Dasakanipāta-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0404a.att","from":438,"to":438,"paras":[{"para":438,"vripara":"16","refs":["an10.16:1"],"lines":["Chaṭṭhe <b>gotrabhū</b>ti sikhāpattavipassanābhūtena nibbānārammaṇena gotrabhuñāṇena samannāgato."],"lineRefs":[["an10.16:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[["an10.16:1.3","gotrabhū",0,0]]},"tika":{"book":"Mp-t-x","bookName":"Dasakanipāta-ṭīkā","vriCode":"s0404t.tik","from":486,"to":489,"paras":[{"para":486,"vripara":"15-16","refs":["an10.16:1"],"lines":["15-16. Pañcame <b>kārāpakaappamādo</b> nāma “ime akusalā dhammā pahātabbā, ime kusalā dhammā upasampādetabbā”ti taṃtaṃparivajjetabbavajjanasampādetabbasampādanavasena pavatto appamādo.","<b>Esā</b>ti appamādo.","<b>Lokiyova</b> na lokuttaro.","<b>Ayañcā</b>ti ca <b>esā</b>ti ca appamādameva vadati.","<b>Tesan</b>ti cātubhūmakadhammānaṃ.","<b>Paṭilābhakattenā</b>ti paṭilābhāpanakattena."],"lineRefs":[["an10.16:1"],["an10.16:1"],["an10.16:1"],["an10.16:1"],["an10.16:1"],["an10.16:1"]]},{"para":487,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["<b>Jaṅgalānan</b>ti jaṅgalacārīnaṃ.","Jaṅgala-saddo cettha kharabhāvasāmaññena pathavīpariyāyo, na anupaṭṭhānavidūradesavācī.","Tenāha <b>“pathavītalacārīnan”</b>ti.","Padānaṃ vuccamānattā <b>“sapādakapāṇānan”</b>ti visesetvā vuttaṃ.","<b>Samodhānan</b>ti antogadhabhāvaṃ.","Tenāha <b>“odhānaṃ pakkhepan”</b>ti.","“Upakkhepan” tipi paṭhanti, upanetvā pakkhipitabbanti attho.","Vassikāya pupphaṃ <b>vassikaṃ</b> yathā “āmalakiyā phalaṃ āmalakan”ti.","<b>Mahātalasmin</b>ti uparipāsāde.","Chaṭṭhaṃ uttānameva."],"lineRefs":[[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[]]},{"para":488,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Appamādasuttādivaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":489,"vripara":null,"refs":["an10.16:1"],"lines":["7-8. Paṭhamanāthasuttādivaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[["an10.16:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[]},"tika2":null}
